  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe new profile UI can break if a bio contains a really long text without any spaces or line breaks in it.\n\nIt results in a horizontal scroll bar appearing. Due to this it also moves the Edit Note, Unfriend, Share and More button to the complete right of the end of the newly created scrollable area.\n\nHere is a link to my broken profile: https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_41e9218b-1c8b-4de3-ad2c-cb6f08557922\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe text box should not be able to expand to the side and should add line breaks to text if necessary.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows how broken it is and the second picture shows how this is handled in the Edit Profile UI:",
